  "name": "OBS Streaming",
  "summary": "Go live, record, switch scenes and mix audio in OBS Studio.",
  "description": "Stream, record, pause, replay buffer and virtual camera on the top row; four scene buttons and the studio-mode controls; the mic mute and a volume slider for one source. Pick your scenes and audio source in each item after adding. Needs OBS's WebSocket server (Tools → WebSocket Server Settings) and the plugin's setup.",
